      "effect": "3 Level 6 monsters\nYou can also Xyz Summon this card by discarding 1 \"Ghostrick\" card and using 1 \"Ghostrick Alucard\" you control (transfer its materials). Cannot be used as material for an Xyz Summon. This face-up card cannot be changed to face-down Defense Position. Once per turn (Quick Effect): You can detach 1 material from this card; destroy all face-down cards your opponent controls. When a Spell/Trap Card is activated (Quick Effect): You can detach 2 materials from this card; negate the activation, and if you do, Set that card.",
